OL,3,GNEWSAPlans made for two new homeless
OL,4,Asleeping pods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has announced its plans to
OL,7,Finstall two more emergency sleeping
OL,8,Fpods for people experiencing
OL,9,Fhomelessness.
OL,11,FCaritas said the two additional pods
OL,12,Fwould be located in St Peter Port,
OL,13,Fbetween the Queen Elizabeth II Marina
OL,14,Fand La Salerie car park, subject to
OL,15,Fplanning approval.
OL,17,FThe charity said the new pods would
OL,18,Fcomplement two emergency pods that were
OL,19,Finstalled at the Vale Douzaine Rooms in
OL,20,FDecember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
