OL,3,GNEWSAPlans made for two new homeless
OL,4,Asleeping pods
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraham Merfield, chair of Caritas,
OL,7,Fsaid: "The pods are not a solution to
OL,8,Fhomelessness in themselves, but they
OL,9,Fprovide an immediate, safe and
OL,10,Fdignified place to stay while people
OL,11,Fwork towards finding more permanent
OL,12,Faccommodation."
